{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/DEMO_EN__6_.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try a mini run of Secret Seeker featuring the first 3 levels from the full game. Test your skills, explore freely, and uncover what was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s included:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels from the full version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All core mechanics: stealth, loadout, time pressure, combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No time limit \u2014 explore at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your personal museum for artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets and hidden stories to discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Not included:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shadow Leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/PortalGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retrieve what no one else dares to touch.\u00a0As an agent of Secret Seekers, you explore forgotten dimensions and recover cursed artifacts. Each place hides its own secret - just don\u2019t run out of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/1.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/MysteryGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: find the objects you're told to find. But nothing about them is ordinary. Some are buried in darkness. Others whisper forgotten truths. Every item you collect pulls you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/2.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/PuzzlesGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each place hides a story no one was meant to hear. The objects you find unlock fragments of it -moments frozen in time, voices left behind. The more you uncover, the less sense it makes. Until it does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/3.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/LocationGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission takes you to a different abandoned reality - broken, twisted, and barely holding together. These places weren't just forgotten. They were erased. You\u2019re not supposed to be there. But you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/4.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/FightGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not alone. Interdimensional guardians roam these places - and they don\u2019t like intruders. Fight if you must. Hide if you can. But whatever you do\u2026 don\u2019t get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/5.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/ShopGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t control the mission. But you can control how you enter it. Every item, every perk, every decision matters. Load up, lock in, and hope it\u2019s enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/6.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/UsableItemsGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is your greatest enemy. The more objects you choose to find, the less of it you\u2019ll have. Explore fast. Decide faster. Fail, and it\u2019s all lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/7.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/HUBGif.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover your personal archive - a mysterious museum that preserves only the most important artifacts you've recovered. It\u2019s a silent gallery of failures and triumphs. Watch it evolve with each expedition...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/8.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Challenging but Fair</strong> \u2013 No hints, no hand-holding. Fail often. Learn more each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Dynamic Loadouts</strong> \u2013 Customize perks and items before every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Fragmented Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Piece together the past through objects and environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Reactive Spaces</strong> \u2013 Your museum evolves with each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Tactile Interaction</strong> \u2013 Pick up, inspect, and sometimes mishandle what you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains psychological tension, horror themes, a sense of unease, and suggestive depictions of supernatural events and violence. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722880?t=1747741038","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722880?t=1747741038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/595c9d025dab9591f37c71338b0f0ddcfde7c091/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747741038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/595c9d025dab9591f37c71338b0f0ddcfde7c091/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747741038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some scenes depict human corpses in a realistic manner. This content may be inappropriate for certain sensitive individuals.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/DEMO_EN__6_.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try a mini run of Secret Seeker featuring the first 3 levels from the full game. Test your skills, explore freely, and uncover what was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s included:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels from the full version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All core mechanics: stealth, loadout, time pressure, combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No time limit \u2014 explore at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your personal museum for artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets and hidden stories to discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Not included:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shadow Leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/PortalGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retrieve what no one else dares to touch.\u00a0As an agent of Secret Seekers, you explore forgotten dimensions and recover cursed artifacts. Each place hides its own secret - just don\u2019t run out of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/1.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/MysteryGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: find the objects you're told to find. But nothing about them is ordinary. Some are buried in darkness. Others whisper forgotten truths. Every item you collect pulls you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/2.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/PuzzlesGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each place hides a story no one was meant to hear. The objects you find unlock fragments of it -moments frozen in time, voices left behind. The more you uncover, the less sense it makes. Until it does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/3.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/LocationGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission takes you to a different abandoned reality - broken, twisted, and barely holding together. These places weren't just forgotten. They were erased. You\u2019re not supposed to be there. But you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/4.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/FightGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not alone. Interdimensional guardians roam these places - and they don\u2019t like intruders. Fight if you must. Hide if you can. But whatever you do\u2026 don\u2019t get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/5.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/ShopGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t control the mission. But you can control how you enter it. Every item, every perk, every decision matters. Load up, lock in, and hope it\u2019s enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/6.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/UsableItemsGIF.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is your greatest enemy. The more objects you choose to find, the less of it you\u2019ll have. Explore fast. Decide faster. Fail, and it\u2019s all lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/7.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/HUBGif.gif?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover your personal archive - a mysterious museum that preserves only the most important artifacts you've recovered. It\u2019s a silent gallery of failures and triumphs. Watch it evolve with each expedition...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/extras/8.png?t=1747741038\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Challenging but Fair</strong> \u2013 No hints, no hand-holding. Fail often. Learn more each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Dynamic Loadouts</strong> \u2013 Customize perks and items before every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Fragmented Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Piece together the past through objects and environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Reactive Spaces</strong> \u2013 Your museum evolves with each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Tactile Interaction</strong> \u2013 Pick up, inspect, and sometimes mishandle what you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains psychological tension, horror themes, a sense of unease, and suggestive depictions of supernatural events and violence. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Radikate"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3528320","name":"Secret Seeker"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722880/dedffa1376c938347107ee443a2dcf7f07a42c1f/header.jpg?t=1747741038","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140728,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140728/movie480.mp4?t=1747728206","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140728/movie_max.mp4?t=1747728206"},"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140728/9a83348850591e40065a4a35ee280d2ec2177a85/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747728206","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140728/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747728206","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140728/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747728206"}}],"name":"Secret Seeker Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 3GB or AMD Radeon RX 570 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I7-8700K or AMD RYZEN 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 2060 or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"wi